  "behavior_changes": "Draft files only under /workspace/work/, package a root SKILL.md ZIP with execute, publish the ZIP using present_artifacts, then upload_skill(file_path) after approval. For an existing name use update_skill(slug,file_path,expected_revision), obtaining the current revision from list_skills. Package validation and static security checks are mandatory; no separate candidate, evaluation or publication gate exists. New uploads are enabled, updates preserve enabled state, and changes take effect on the next new execution. review_skill_package(slug) is optional read-only inspection, not runtime verification. Use set_skill_enabled or delete_skill with the current revision and human approval. Existing executions and resumes retain their snapshot. Use request_information for interviews. No host/global installation or local browser server.",
